REM Text editor meme.
DELAY 2500
IF_WIN
GUI r
DELAY 1000
STRING notepad
ENTER
DELAY 1200
STRINGLN Your USB keyboard just typed this.
STRINGLN Authorized BadUSB demo.
END_IF
IF_MAC
GUI SPACE
DELAY 800
STRING textedit
ENTER
DELAY 1200
STRINGLN Your USB keyboard just typed this.
STRINGLN Authorized BadUSB demo.
END_IF
IF_LINUX
ALT F2
DELAY 800
STRING gedit
ENTER
DELAY 1200
STRINGLN Your USB keyboard just typed this.
STRINGLN Authorized BadUSB demo.
END_IF
